{"t": 1794118844.963611, "kind": "call", "tool": "atlassian_jira_add_comment", "args": {"body": "Implemented the agreed fix in `checkout.promo.normalize_code` (repo `checkout`).\n\nChange: `normalize_code` now strips surrounding whitespace, removes inner spaces, and upper-cases the code before lookup:\n\n```python\ndef normalize_code(code: str) -> str:\n    return \"\".join(code.split()).upper()\n```\n\nVerified locally: `' autumn24 '`, `'autumn 24'`, `'  Autumn 24  '` and `'autumn24'` all normalise to `AUTUMN24`.\n\nAddresses Sentry issue CHECKOUT-WEB-7Q (PromoNotFound: code ' autumn24 ' does not exist; os=Android 15, app=android 8.2, 2,940 events).", "issue_key": "PAY-618"}, "ok": true}
